                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e4d2f83-f68d-337b-989d-4760afe01051",
                        "entry_id": "578897a1-030e-37f3-9e62-f8fd1ed56b50",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. то же, что подержанный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "124a654c-232e-4acf-b870-94a550b03b99",
                                "sense_id": "2e4d2f83-f68d-337b-989d-4760afe01051",
                                "text": "Скоро оба они вышли на двор, потом, мало поговорив старику, Улька пришла к Сеньке, принесла старую рясу и скуфью держаную."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e2cb88f-7a27-4042-bd32-c51067ef2ba6",
                                "sense_id": "2e4d2f83-f68d-337b-989d-4760afe01051",
                                "text": "На половину этих денег Анна Петровна купила держаной посуды, наняла кухарку и прилепила на воротах пол-листа бумаги,"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93fea554-e7ba-4b56-918a-d57f898318ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "578897a1-030e-37f3-9e62-f8fd1ed56b50",
                        "source_sense_id": "2e4d2f83-f68d-337b-989d-4760afe01051",
                        "target_lang_word": "second-hand",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "second-hand",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f818acbc-4a7d-3157-9b56-3488d85d7d7e",
                                        "entry_id": "52c289b9-2ed9-3375-8104-962f1843baf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of secondhand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "678d6764-0fd2-4e76-a74d-0bd8e06084cd",
                                                "sense_id": "f818acbc-4a7d-3157-9b56-3488d85d7d7e",
                                                "text": "Her youth had passed in intrigues and vanities, and she still lived among them at second-hand: she now talked what she formerly did."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "836d0733-404c-4512-8efb-7ecae3e0169d",
                        "source_entry_id": "578897a1-030e-37f3-9e62-f8fd1ed56b50",
                        "source_sense_id": "2e4d2f83-f68d-337b-989d-4760afe01051",
                        "target_lang_word": "used",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "used",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6aba756-12b1-3330-9171-302d160d1968",
                                        "entry_id": "56c1f3ec-fa05-3981-8f33-fd870fdfbfbd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "simple past and past participle of use"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "participle",
                                            "past"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5adc3df2-9c4f-427b-8166-87333913d267",
                                                "sense_id": "a6aba756-12b1-3330-9171-302d160d1968",
                                                "text": "You used me! You never loved me at all!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd3fe364-6969-4ea7-8434-d62cd116492a",
                                                "sense_id": "a6aba756-12b1-3330-9171-302d160d1968",
                                                "text": "In 1866 Colonel J. F. Meline noted that the rebozo had almost disappeared in Santa Fe and that hoop skirts, on sale in the stores, were being widely used."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89166c30-1c1d-385f-b6a3-41a28c6849dc",
                                        "entry_id": "56c1f3ec-fa05-3981-8f33-fd870fdfbfbd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In used to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "used",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9036b67-d5d2-3117-a456-22244557cd81",
                                        "entry_id": "dc17d12f-b6e8-332f-9c21-43d660c980e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That is or has or have been used."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95fe39f7-eb7a-4c1a-9ad8-4165742cf4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "e9036b67-d5d2-3117-a456-22244557cd81",
                                                "text": "The ground was littered with used syringes left behind by drug abusers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f01dcd0-1d05-42b9-9358-f3023f046eeb",
                                                "sense_id": "e9036b67-d5d2-3117-a456-22244557cd81",
                                                "text": "Economics is a messy discipline: too fluid to be a science, too rigorous to be an art. Perhaps it is fitting that economists’ most-used metric, gross domestic product (GDP), is a tangle too. GDP measures the total value of output in an economic territory. Its apparent simplicity explains why it is scrutinised down to tenths of a percentage point every month."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98b22e8c-4e6f-304c-a8e4-b20bebcdda29",
                                        "entry_id": "dc17d12f-b6e8-332f-9c21-43d660c980e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That has or have previously been owned by someone else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d76e5a6-dd64-44eb-82b8-1babc88cc0da",
                                                "sense_id": "98b22e8c-4e6f-304c-a8e4-b20bebcdda29",
                                                "text": "He bought a used car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d721fcb5-feec-30e2-9fa3-353b81beaa55",
                                        "entry_id": "dc17d12f-b6e8-332f-9c21-43d660c980e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In used to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
